y is an incremental game about chopping trees. You cut wood, process it, sell it, and spend the money on upgrades. Then you go cut more wood, faster. It starts with one guy and one axe, and it gets out of hand fairly quickly. Free Demo Around 40 minutes ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-16T07:11:37Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706680382","verified_at":"2026-10-20T23:08:29Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5129170-1845383656393084","game_id":"steam-5129170","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update - New Languages & Improved Language Selection","summary":"New Languages Added Polish, Turkish, Spanish (Latin America), Italian, Ukrainian, Czech, Indonesian, and Vietnamese. The existing Spanish option is now labeled \"Spanish (Spain)\". Language Selection Improvements Fixed an issue where some languages (German, French, Portuguese, Spanish, Russian) were not shown on the language selection screen at first launch. The language selection screen has been redesigned so you can scroll left and right through languages. Mouse wheel and gamepad controls are no","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-05T10:25:00Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656393084","verified_at":"2026-10-20T23:08:29Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5129170-1844751498223814","game_id":"steam-5129170","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update - Log Swap System & Forest Results Screen Overhaul","summary":"Forest Results Screen Overhaul The forest expedition results screen now shows the loot you collected during the run. New: Log Swap System When your inventory or cargo crate is full, you can now empty a slot of cheaper logs to make room for more valuable ones. Swap key: Tab (keyboard) / Y 